From 09ee0a35f6eec2e43d03aded4c21a79ec80edbc5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Spatiand-build <claude@prasetya.id>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 12:18:05 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Spatiand: each tab's sound at the room's window it is in

The room gives every SpatiMesh window a sink of its own, keyed by this process and the window's
Wayland surface (ui::PlatformWindow::GetSpatiandSurfaceId), and lists them in
$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/spatiand-sinks. SpatiandWindowAudio makes each tab's preferred output its
window's sink, so its streams switch as it moves to another window.
---
